// # list — List Primitives
//
// Logline: The OoIList (int list), OoSList (string list), OoFList (float list), the nested list types (OoLL_*, OoLLL_*, OoLLLL_* via the X-macro compressor in llist.c), and the set (subset) primitive.
//
// Setup: list.c is OoIList; flist.c is OoFList; list_set.c is the set primitive; llist.c is the X-macro-compressed nested lists (Int/String/Float × 2D/3D/4D).
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read list.c — OoIList retain/release/new/push/get/set/len.
//   2. Read flist.c — OoFList (the same shape, float element).
//   3. Read list_set.c — set operations.
//   4. Read llist.c — nested lists (OoLL_*, OoLLL_*, OoLLLL_*) via X-macro.
//
// ──▓▓ list ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: 9 type families — Int/String/Float × 2D/3D/4D ::
